  by U of T John H. Daniels Faculty of Architecture
LOCATION:1 Spadina Crescent
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.daniels.utoronto.ca/events/1780612200/carbon-confessions-arch
 itecture-understanding-emissions\n\nHosted by U of T John H. Daniels
  Faculty of Architecture (https://www.daniels.utoronto.ca)\n\nHow is
  carbon reshaping architecture and cities? Join MVRDV for a keynote on
  design\, policy\, and the future of the built environment. As part of
